| **3** | **No error handling middleware** | Uncaught errors bubble to Express’ default error handler, which may leak stack traces or internal information to the client. | ```js\napp.use((err, req, res, next) => {\n  console.error(err);\n  res.status(500).json({ error: 'Internal Server Error' });\n});\n``` |
