});

// ---------- Server start ----------
const PORT = process.env.PORT || 3000;
app.listen(PORT, () => {
  console.log(`Server running on port ${PORT}`);
});

module.exports = app;
```

*Only the security‑related additions are mandatory; the rest (CORS origin, rate‑limit thresholds) should be tuned to your operational context.*

