## 7️⃣  General Recommendations & Hardening Checklist  

| ✅ | Recommendation | Why |
|---|----------------|-----|
| 1 | **Helmet** for security headers. | Prevents a wide class of client‑side attacks. |
| 2 | **CORS** with whitelist. | Restricts which origins can call your API. |
